  "notes": "rdx at the call is a join of a previous call's clobber and a dead idivl remainder, and `sub_401031`'s own recovered prototype takes one parameter. The default drops the trailing argument, the phantom `// rdx` local it read and the remainder that fed it.",
  "probe_id": "p-2b1bd69dbec3"
}
